WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
Repair follows evidence-based triage.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:06.080
Reproduce the failure,
identify its owner, propose

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.760
a change and run independent checks
while preserving the domain assertion.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.320
A temporary quarantine is a different
path for a confirmed flaky test.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.040
It needs an owner, expiry, repair
ticket and replacement coverage.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.280
Retain the resolution and versions,
and recheck the exception until

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:27.600
it is restored. Hiding a failing
test is not the same as fixing it.
